   1:Source/ui/chrome.c **** /*
   2:Source/ui/chrome.c ****  * PlutoBrowser — chrome.c
   3:Source/ui/chrome.c ****  * Top chrome / navigation toolbar (port of Source/ui/chrome.lua).
   4:Source/ui/chrome.c ****  * Every element preserved: black bar + white separator, SSL padlock or globe
   5:Source/ui/chrome.c ****  * icon, host/title text (28-char truncation), [READ]/[WEB] badge, animated
   6:Source/ui/chrome.c ****  * comet loading dots + progress bar (or the clock), white-fill text draw mode.
   7:Source/ui/chrome.c ****  */
